{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:41 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:41 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:41 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"老婦捱撞倒地受傷。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22df09f8ea8f7969a0ec33c7f65108ba/2026-11/888_18.jpg\"/><p>今（14日）中午12時許，一輛客貨車沿通明街行駛，駛至牛頭角道交界時，撞到一名75歲老婦，她仆倒地上，面部流血及腳部受傷，昏迷送院搶救。</p><p>網上圖片顯示，傷者面朝地倒臥地上，多名熱心途人幫手，有人上前了解老婦傷勢，有人報警求助。</p><img alt=\"老婦捱撞倒地受傷。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7698414557414a6abc7eb0577cbc5cd5/2026-11/01_2_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"老婦捱撞倒地受傷。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e9e3c74a9d524ac0eb3e821e726e6f7/2026-11/02_2_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"老婦送院治理。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76363a3de63a9a2fef587ac9fe2c8ff7/2026-11/03_5_8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"多名熱心途人在場幫手。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/319c719fc0326b3ece1aad94c7d8e6cf/2026-11/04_7_22.jpg\"/><img alt=\"老婦送院治理。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/504caa22656dc43750944d4611aa67a1/2026-11/05_2_4.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:59:50.189569+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:41:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:28.167491+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:53:17.362216+00:00","content_hash":"824bcf4fbc5a55e52eda805c05b2020febe25757d32405a9d828b8cb5b3febb0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}